    <bpmn:process id="W_W5113" name="W5113. Regional/District Store-Visit Cadence, Routing &amp; Itinerary Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cadence policy; territory assignment (W5106); monthly/quarterly plan
Frequency: Monthly planning + continuous
Volume: ~33 stores per Regional Manager / ~15 per District Manager (profile §12.1) × tier-based cadence (DM ~monthly; RM ~quarterly+) → ~180–360 visits/yr per DM, ~130–200 per RM
Owner: Regional/District Manager
Participants: Director Field Retail Operations, Store Managers (VS-07), Analytics (VS-28), Travel/Fleet (VS-06/VS-61), Operations Compliance Lead, Field Compliance Auditor
Source: workflow W5113 — Regional/District Store-Visit Cadence, Routing &amp; Itinerary Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5113_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5113_Lane1" name="Regional">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5113_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5113_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5113_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5113_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5113_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5113_Start3" name="Cadence policy; territory assignment (W5106); monthly/quarterly plan">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5113_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5113_Task4" name="Set the visit cadence: standard visit frequency by store tier (A/B/C/D from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Set the visit cadence: standard visit frequency by store tier (A/B/C/D from W5109), the visit-type mix (full audit, coaching, drop-in, targeted), and the calendar build across the territory
Responsible (R): Regional/District Manager
Accountable (A): Regional/District Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5113_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5113_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5113_Task5" name="Optimize routing &amp; logistics: route/travel plan (island geography), the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Optimize routing &amp; logistics: route/travel plan (island geography), the unannounced-visit ratio for objectivity, and the pre-visit prep (performance review, prior action-items W5118)
Responsible (R): Regional/District Manager
Accountable (A): Regional/District Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5113_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5113_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5113_Task6" name="Communicate &amp; coordinate: share the cadence with Store Managers (the announced…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Communicate &amp; coordinate: share the cadence with Store Managers (the announced portion), coordinate with LP/operations-standards specialists, and log the plan in the field system
Responsible (R): Regional/District Manager / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Regional/District Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5113_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5113_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5113_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5113_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5113_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-762 (ensure controlled execution — Store Visit, Field Coaching &amp; Retail Standards Execution (PA-177.2).) | - CTL-762: cadence per policy (tier-based); unannounced-visit ratio enforced; visit log complete
Owner: Regional/District Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5113_Assoc9" sourceRef="W5113_Annotation8" targetRef="W5113_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5113_Flow10" sourceRef="W5113_Start3" targetRef="W5113_Task4" />
