    <bpmn:process id="W_W5120" name="W5120. Field Coaching Quality, Visit Effectiveness &amp; Standards-Compliance Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly review; continuous monitoring
Frequency: Monthly + continuous
Volume: ~all visits/coaches/stores across the 200-store chain
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Store Ops (VS-07), Strategy (VS-33), HR (VS-103), LP (VS-23), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W5120 — Field Coaching Quality, Visit Effectiveness &amp; Standards-Compliance Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5120_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5120_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5120_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5120_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5120_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5120_Lane2" name="Director Field Retail Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5120_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5120_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5120_Start4" name="Monthly/quarterly review; continuous monitoring">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5120_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5120_Task5" name="Measure coaching &amp; visit effectiveness: visit cadence adherence, action-item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Measure coaching &amp; visit effectiveness: visit cadence adherence, action-item closure rate/effectiveness, coaching-quality scores, and the visit-to-performance-improvement linkage
Responsible (R): Analytics / Director Field Retail Operations
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5120_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5120_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5120_Task6" name="Measure standards-compliance consistency: audit-score consistency across…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Measure standards-compliance consistency: audit-score consistency across managers (W5114), the gaming-detection signal, and the independent-assurance reconciliation (VS-146)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Director Field Retail Operations / LP
Accountable (A): Director Field Retail Operations
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5120_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5120_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5120_Task7" name="Review &amp; improve: leadership review (VS-36), the field-program improvement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Review &amp; improve: leadership review (VS-36), the field-program improvement actions (VS-133), and the recognition/feedback to field managers (W5112)
Responsible (R): Director Field Retail Operations / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5120_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5120_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5120_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5120_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5120_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-762 (ensure controlled execution — Store Visit, Field Coaching &amp; Retail Standards Execution (PA-177.2).) | - CTL-762: outcome (not just activity) measured; consistency checked vs assurance (VS-146); improvement actions tracked (VS-133)
Owner: Director Field Retail Operations / Analytics (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
